        <div class="col-xs-12 abut_bodyhead"><h2>About us</h2></div>
        <div class="col-xs-12 abut_bodyPrt">
            <p>Viman is the trading name of Travelopedia Ltd. Within the short span of time the company has achieved many milestones and has grown into a new evolution. It is totally an independent family owned business comprised a group of passionate people creating the unique travel experience for its esteemed clients. We strongly believe in customer satisfaction by providing them top-notch services in every aspect so that they can enjoy a pleasing travel experience. Viman believes in making every vacation a dream vacation and providing you unexpected returns on the valuable vacation time you invest with us.</p>
         	 <h3>We Build Trust</h3>
            <p>We are member of ATOL. The ATOL (11087) exists in order to protect you. This means that every penny that you pay to our members is protected by the ATOL.</p>
            <p>We are a Member of ABTA, membership number [Y6610/P7401]. We are obliged to maintain a high standard of service to you by ABTA’s Code of Conduct. We can also offer you ABTA’s scheme for the resolution of disputes which is approved by the Chartered Trading Standards Institute. If we can’t resolve your complaint, go to www.abta.com to use ABTA’s simple procedure. Further information on the Code and ABTA’s assistance in resolving disputes can be found on www.abta.com. You can also access the European Commission Online Dispute (ODR) Resolution platform at http://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr/. This ODR platform is a means of registering your complaint with us; it will not determine how your complaint should be resolved.</p>
            <p>Whether you are interested in exploring different cultures or inclined towards the music and festivals of a particular destination or simply want to relax on beautiful snow-capped mountains or amazing beaches, we are experts at handcrafting unique travel experiences just for you. At Viman we offer unmatched services to our valuable clients that include flights bookings, hotel bookings, car rentals, insurance, airport lounges, airport parking’s, cruises, last minute deals etc. We have a team of hugely experienced, loyal and friendly people who understand your specific interests and vacation preferences and crafts tailored based unique itinerary for you so that you can enjoy a great holiday trip with your family and loved ones.</p>

             <p style="font-weight:bold;">Book with confidence! Viman provides a guarantee against default and fraud.</p>
            <h3>Mission</h3>
            <p>We understand your needs and constantly strive to give you the best while balancing quality and cost and for this, we are happy to go that extra mile. We value your trust and our endeavors to offer you the best travel experience from start to finish.</p>
            <h3>Why Viman</h3>
            <p>We are a leading player in online flight and hotel booking. We offer some of the lowest airfares, exclusive discounts and seamless booking service along with round the clock customer support. Many of the traditional big brand operators don’t have the flexibility that we have because we are independent with no middleman and thus always pass the savings onto you. So avail our unmatched online booking services which are just a few clicks away and enjoy one of the best holiday experiences of your life.</p>
           
